{"tool":"calculate","arguments":{"expression":"reserve_2006 - reserve_2005","variables":{"reserve_2006":10,"reserve_2005":4},"sources":{"reserve_2006":"source:q11n3","reserve_2005":"source:q11n4"}},"message":"The change in the reserve for product warranties from 2005 to 2006 is the 2006 reserve minus the 2005 reserve. Source q11 states the reserve was $10 million in 2006 and $4 million in 2005; both amounts are in USD millions."}